OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader set up fake
OL,4,Asociety, fraud trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Ashfield District Council
OL,7,Fset up a fake heritage group in a bid
OL,8,Fto defraud a council out of thousands
OL,9,Fof pounds, a court has heard.
OL,11,FAshfield Independent councillor Jason
OL,12,FZadrozny is accused of setting up the
OL,13,FAshfield Heritage Society (AHS) in 2018
OL,14,Fbefore applying for funding from
OL,15,FNottinghamshire County Council and
OL,16,Ftransferring it into his personal
OL,17,Faccount.
OL,19,FDuring a trial at Northampton Crown
OL,20,FCourt on Tuesday, prosecutors said he
OL,21,Falso failed to pay tax on four rental
OL,22,Fproperties.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
