OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader set up fake
OL,4,Asociety, fraud trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 46-year-old, of Stanton Hill,
OL,7,Fpleaded not guilty to 12 counts of
OL,8,Ffraud and four counts of tax evasion.
